  "details": "Description\n\nInput dialog layer appears behind quick menu when you try to change request invite messsage. Quick menu keeps on top of input dialog.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Open quick menu\n\n1. Select user on the left or right wing\n\n2. Press Request invite\n\n3. Select ADD MESSAGE\n\n4. Select edit on the first message\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-04_23-08-20.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_bc97c84d-c256-4fe3-a501-85d5d6223b31/1/file)",
